<section class="hpSec" id="hpPrivacy">
  <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
  <p><b>No accounts, no tracking.</b> coPaint does not ask for names, emails or any personal information.</p>
  <p>Drawings are stored only in your browser on your device (autosave). They are never uploaded anywhere.</p>
  <p>If you join a collaboration room, your drawing strokes and chosen display name are sent through a public message service so the other people in the same room can see them — only while you are in the room. Room codes are random; keep your code and password private if you want a private room.</p>
  <p>We do not sell data, and we do not knowingly collect information from children beyond what is needed for rooms to work.</p>
</section>
